WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.670
Good evening. I have a reservation under the name Martin.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.309
For two nights, correct?

00:00:07.559 --> 00:00:10.675
Yes. Is breakfast included?

00:00:10.925 --> 00:00:13.921
Yes, from seven to ten.

00:00:14.171 --> 00:00:16.607
Good. Where is my room?

00:00:16.857 --> 00:00:20.094
On the second floor. Here is your key.
